<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hylsamex started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hylsamex started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bankers Trust said it had started coverage of Mexican steel company Hylsamex SA de CV with a rating of market perform.</p>
<p>-- Analysts Karen Miller and Jordan Estra wrote in a Friday report that recent favorable Mexican economic statistics and a spate of privatizations set the stage for a heightened consumption of steel.</p>
<p>-- They set a 12-month price target of 37 pesos a share. The stock closed at 30 in Mexico on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879</p>
